{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>A thorn</b> — that came into the hand of a drunkard to harm people with it." "<b>And a proverb in the mouth of fools</b> — compares it to a harmful thorn, because he speaks a proverb and has no sense."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:48.369776823Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}